@Instartups.Query.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8082
@Token = COLE_AQUI_O_ACCESS_TOKEN
@PerfilId = COLE_AQUI_O_ID_DO_PERFIL

### Q1 · Meu perfil
GET {{Instartups.Query.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instartups/query/perfil/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Q2 · Perfil público
GET {{Instartups.Query.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instartups/query/perfil/{{PerfilId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Q3 · Feed (todos)
GET {{Instartups.Query.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instartups/query/feed?limite=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Q3 · Feed (startups filtradas por setor e raio; cole o proximoCursor em &cursor=)
GET {{Instartups.Query.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instartups/query/feed?tipo=startup&setores=SAUDE&setores=AGRONEGOCIOS&raioKm=50&limite=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Q4 · Postagens do perfil (no meu perfil, inclui as desativadas)
GET {{Instartups.Query.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instartups/query/perfil/{{PerfilId}}/postagens?limite=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Q4 · Postagens do perfil (próxima página; cole o proximoCursor em &cursor=)
GET {{Instartups.Query.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instartups/query/perfil/{{PerfilId}}/postagens?limite=2&cursor=
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Q5 · Setores
GET {{Instartups.Query.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instartups/query/setores
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Q5 · Setores (busca sem acento: "saude" encontra "Saúde")
GET {{Instartups.Query.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instartups/query/setores?busca=saude
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

###
